{"parse": {"title": "8TH-08", "pageid": 69772, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-07\" title=\"8TH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">8TH-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-09\" title=\"8TH-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">8TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.B3.E4.B8.8A.E7.9A.84.E7.94.9F.E4.B8.8E.E6.AD.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"河上的生与死\">河上的生与死</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 河上的生与死</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On the Margins of Life and Death</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>漫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>长<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>苦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>难<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>幸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>福<span class=\"color-value\"></span>比<span class=\"color-value\"></span>天<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>太<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10808</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a7/Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_yuanfangdeguren.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>暴力在这里并非解决纠纷的手段，而是一种习惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>神秘学家和人类混居在同一片区域，他们同样热情，也同样易于躁动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>而遥远的北方是曾被称作新英格兰的繁华海岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这里，则是一片暴力、苦难和流血纷争的土地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这个国家因咖啡和蔗糖而闻名。过去的五个世纪里，从马德里的王公到热那亚的金融家，整个欧洲都曾享用其血肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>难以置信的巨富和同样令人不敢相信的绝对赤贫相依相伴，它们之间的距离有时仅仅只是一条街的宽度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>跨国公司切开了拉丁美洲的血管，扎进针管，从中抽走它旺盛蓬勃的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>留下混乱与血腥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>敬爱的读者们，这就是我正身处的土地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧哗的河岸边，医生敲打着打字机。孩子们聚在她身旁，围观这个古怪的小机器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>小船，这儿的人一直都这样生活着吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>1681年的拿骚港和1990年的圣保罗，说真的，医生，在我看来就是一回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>大自然对这儿很慷慨，充足的光照、热量和水，这本该是一片富饶的土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漫长的夏日，如同这个国家漫长的苦难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>以前我总是会做一些模糊的梦……去到一些陌生的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>泰晤士河畔的雾都、一个很冷很冷的北国小镇……我还遇到了很多人，只是现在都记不起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>噢，提到这个，圣萨尔瓦多岛的伊洛潘戈湖里有种水草，当地人把这东西采出来，伴着玉米做成糊糊，吃下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>然后呢，然后……哈哈，然后你就会想起发生过的所有事！所有的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贫民区小孩：</div><div>哇啊……那是什么好宝贝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们围坐在瓶中船“身”边，好奇地问着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>喔，那东西叫白痴草，哈哈哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>一个人要是什么都记得住，那这个倒霉的蠢蛋，离发疯就不远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>我倒是宁愿什么都能记得。遗忘很痛苦，小船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>好了，羊癫草只是一个可爱的传说。小船，它像沙漠半岛里的魅魔传说一样，很多年都没人见过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>噢，魅魔，哈哈，男人们听到这个，都得站起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提到这个话题，瓶中船又开始胡说八道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>88年——当然，我是说1688年，摩根大副在贝卢港捡到了某个魅魔的封印物，然后遇见了那该死的魅魔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>接下来，他失踪了一个月。好吧……我承认一个月有点夸大，但他确实死在贝卢港。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这儿没人能戳穿她的谎言，但也没人真的相信她的胡言乱语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小孩子们漫不经心地听她讲故事，不时东张西望，意外瞧见水上漂来两条“大鱼”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贫民区小孩：</div><div>嘿，那边有人落水了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个浮在水上的人影。她们混在塑料瓶堆中间，呛着贫民区的脏水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个抱着另一个，正在奋力游向岸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>怎么回事……？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>喂，快醒醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>喂……喂！你可别淹死了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>喂……喂……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_juzhuqu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利拍拍落水伙伴的脸，试图叫醒她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>明明还在呼吸啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>呼……这是怎么一回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>紧跟在小船身后赶来的，是盲眼医生和孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看到一群陌生人赶来，金伯利略微警惕地耸起了肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>小姐，你还好吗？需要我的帮助吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>没什么，只是船爆炸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>老天，我好好的，还没炸呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶中船晃荡几下，示意自己的健康“无损”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>不，我说的可是一艘游轮！总之，我们都掉到了水里，一路漂向这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从上游顺着水流漂下，来到这儿——一座贫民区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>她应该还有个一起的朋友，但她不见了，我只能抱着她一起漂流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>小船，落水的人情况怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>还有呼吸，活着呢！不过……啧啧，恐怕也没那么乐观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>小姐，请把她放到地上，侧卧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利一一照做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>你要做什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生熟练地跪下，把女孩口中的污秽掏出，确保呼吸通畅后，开始按压胸部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>救她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一下，一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是职业本能，也是医者的神圣精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一种不可思议的冲动催促着她对溺水的女孩施展救援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>哈……呼……哈……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>溺水者开始呛出脏污的河水，医生继续帮她恢复呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>很快就会康复了，好孩子。没事的，保持呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她慢慢咳出更多积水，但四肢乏力，躺在地上没法动弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-310101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>我看事情没那么简单……她发烧了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生伸手摸向额头——手背滚烫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>她发烧了……带她回去，得去弄点药。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>帮帮忙，请把她抬到我背上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利没有多说什么，帮着盲眼医生背起了发烧的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>……她很轻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们跑在前边，为医生扯开拦路晾晒的衣服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>这不像是普通的发热，或许感染了河内的热毒菌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>别担心，我会帮助你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医生自言自语，又或许是在安抚陷入昏迷的病人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>喂，等等我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝医生：</div><div>带她回家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶中船跟在身后，金伯利女郎追上医生——等回过神来，她发现，自己已经跟着走了很远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走进了医生的“家”。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "8TH-08"}}